ndices-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="appendices">Related links</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="appendices-content"><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading u-visually-hidden" id="App1">Related links</h3><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="Sec3">FURTHER INFORMATION</h3><p>
                    <a href="http://www.clinicaltrials.gov">ClinicalTrials.gov website</a>
                  </p><p>
